<title>JAPAN: Nichiko Pharm - 95/96 group results.</title>
<headline>Nichiko Pharm - 95/96 group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to November 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 11.63		vs	   13.03</p>
<p> Operating   loss 541    million    vs	prft 594 million</p>
<p> Current     loss 807    million    vs	prft 379 million</p>
<p> Net	     loss 3.10		vs	 prft 50 million</p>
<p> EPS	   loss 106.50 yen	  vs     prft 1.73 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Nichiko Pharmaceutical Co Ltd is a medium-scale maker of prescription drugs for the circulatory system.</p>
</text>
